Round 163d: the stream sentry (a member class of basic_ostream defined
outside it, [temp.mem.class]/1) is no longer dropped, so its constructor
and the tie()/flush() and locale code behind it are executed; the loop and
recursion bound keeps symbolic execution within the time limit.
iostream with cerr, operator<<, and std::endl in C++11.
